EDA will be used to identify patterns in the logistics data.
Examples of questions include:
4.	What percentage of delivery events are completed on time?
5.	Which facilities or locations have higher detention times?
6.	Which routes have the longest or most variable trip durations?
7.	Which trucks or drivers show lower fuel efficiency?
8.	Is idle time associated with trip distance or duration?
9.	Which operational factors are associated with late deliveries?
10.	Which assets or routes may require further investigation for efficiency or maintenance?
